Mount point for exporter secret files (KIONGA_LOG_EXPORT_*_FILE).
Keep real secrets out of Git: everything here except this README is ignored.

gateway.env (optional): KIONGA_KB_SECRET_*, KIONGA_CONNECTION_SECRET_*,
KIONGA_FEATURE_SECRET_*, KIONGA_STORAGE_SECRET_* and KIONGA_PLATFORM_SECRET_* values
for the gateway, one NAME=value per line. Recreate the gateway after changing it.
